			"notes": "How many of these will I make?\n* Current shard is now primarily read from tab header. Dimension is still checked if tab isn't loaded, but there should be no more false world name spoof warnings (build shard doesn't count).\n* Now explicitly setting encoding when saving files to prevent issues when system defaults to a different encoding.\n* A few fixes and improvements for waypoint functionality.\n* Fixed MID mixins to work with my port of it.\n* Purpose of info-sharing buttons was made more clear through displaying some text.\n* Changed sort order for entry filtering."
